      "seed": 356050220,
      "version": 526,
      "versionNonce": 1120255656,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789888702201,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- who can edit?\n    AuthorId == CurrentUserId\n\n2- Time Limit \n    1 hour, after that you can not edit your post\n\n3- History/Versioning?\n    Without History\n\n4- Pure Repost vs Quote ?\n    Pure: Can not edit cuz no content\n    Quote; can edit\n\n5- Media Replacement Strategy\n    Replace all\n\n6- Conccuerncy\n    Using ExecuteUpdate\n    if affectedRows =1\n        return success\n    else\n        return conflict\n\n7- Post already deleted\n    return 404 NotFound\n\n8- Empty Edit\n    Return 204 NoContent\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- who can edit?\n    AuthorId == CurrentUserId\n\n2- Time Limit \n    1 hour, after that you can not edit your post\n\n3- History/Versioning?\n    Without History\n\n4- Pure Repost vs Quote ?\n    Pure: Can not edit cuz no content\n    Quote; can edit\n\n5- Media Replacement Strategy\n    Replace all\n\n6- Conccuerncy\n    Using ExecuteUpdate\n    if affectedRows =1\n        return success\n    else\n        return conflict\n\n7- Post already deleted\n    return 404 NotFound\n\n8- Empty Edit\n    Return 204 NoContent\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
